        <p><i>Letters, like lost children, try to find connections across boundaries and differences. They call out their individual letter names, coming together in a raucous, cacophonous song urging all weirdos to come together.</i></p>
        </br>
    <p><i>The animation is made by mashing together 3D models of children, letters, and numbers. The characters are animated with motion-capture data, and manipulated and assembled inside of Touchdesigner.</i></p>
        </br>

